---
import { workflowStages } from "../../data/how-i-work";
---
<figure class="how-panel how-workflow" aria-labelledby="workflow-caption">
  <div class="how-panel__bar">
    <span>agent-workbench / main flow</span>
    <span class="how-state">human-controlled</span>
  </div>
  <ol class="how-workflow__grid">
    {workflowStages.map((stage, index) => (
      <li class="how-gate">
        <span class="how-gate__index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
        <h3>{stage.label}</h3>
        <p class="how-gate__question">{stage.question}</p>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>artifact</dt><dd>{stage.artifact}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>owner</dt><dd>{stage.owner}</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
  <figcaption id="workflow-caption">A gate can be compressed for small work, but its decision does not disappear. Evidence closes the loop; agent confidence does not.</figcaption>
</figure>
